**In your page file:**
```python
def __init__(self, driver, actions):
    self.driver = driver
    self.actions = actions
    self.P_SELECT_SPAN_XPATH = ("xpath", "//form//div//div//p-select//span[@class='span_class_name']")
    self.LI_OPTION_1_ID = "option_1"
    self.LI_OPTION_2_ID = "option_2"
    self.LI_OPTION_3_ID = "option_3"

def select_dropdown_option_by_li_id(self, li_id):
    self.actions.click(self.P_SELECT_SPAN_XPATH)
    self.actions.wait_for_element_visible(("xpath", f"//li[@id='{li_id}']"))
    self.actions.click(("xpath", f"//li[@id='{li_id}']"))
```

**In your test:**
```python
page.select_dropdown_option_by_li_id(page.LI_OPTION_1_ID)
```

Replace `option_1`, `option_2`, etc. with your actual li id values.
